Due to the current U.S. Government shutdown, Intel has been unable to conclude its consultation with the staff of the SEC. If the staff of the SEC were to have a different view of the appropriate accounting treatment of these transactions, Intel may revise its third quarter 2025 financial results, including the recognition of additional costs or losses, and any such revisions could be material.
For a description of the transactions with the U.S. Government entered into during the third quarter of 2025, see our Current Reports on Form 8-K filed with the SEC on August 25, 2025 and August 29, 2025.
